## License

The McNdroid dataset metadata declares the dataset under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** license.

A separate top-level license for the source code is not currently declared in this repository. Users should verify the applicable terms before redistributing or integrating the code into other projects.

---

## Responsible Use

McNdroid is intended for defensive cybersecurity research, reproducible benchmarking, and analysis of machine-learning behavior under non-stationary distributions. It is not a deployment-ready malware detector and should not be used as the sole basis for operational blocking, application takedown, legal attribution, or commercial threat-intelligence claims.

Labels and malware-family verdicts may inherit disagreement, naming inconsistency, and temporal changes from antivirus vendors. Results should therefore be interpreted within the benchmark’s temporal splits, released modalities, and documented limitations.

---

## Contributing and Support

Contributions that improve reproducibility, documentation, portability, or experimental coverage are welcome.

* Open an [issue](https://github.com/IQSeC-Lab/McNdroid/issues) for bugs, missing instructions, or data-loading problems.
* Use a pull request for code or documentation changes.
* Include the affected module, command, environment, data path convention, and complete error message when reporting a problem.

For dataset-specific questions, use the GitHub issue tracker or the community discussion page associated with the Hugging Face dataset.
